; A golden that moves one variable: the NoiseTexture2D is 1024 pixels tall, past one 512-row
; upload band at 1024 wide, so it reaches the GPU in two bands (ADR-0042). Every other golden's
; texture fits one band and uploads whole, so a seam, a skipped or a doubled row shows only here.
; Drawn at scale 1, one texel to one pixel, with the band seam at texture row 512 in frame.

